    "title": "Nick Houck to be arraigned Thursday on perjury judges - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Melissa Ratliff WAVE Staff ,\n8 hours ago LOUISVILLE, Ky. (WAVE) -Nick Houck will be arraigned in Nelson County court on a perjury charge following his arrest earlier this month. Kentucky State Police arrested Brooks Houck’s brother on a perjury charge. KSP took Nicholas “Nick” Houck into custody June 5 on a Nelson County indictment warrant shortly after 1:30 p.m. He was lodged in the Nelson County Detention Center. Read full article\n4",
